">🛡️</text><text x=\"200.0\" y=\"185.0\" fill=\"#FFB800\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"800\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans,Arial,sans-serif\">CIPC · Companies Act 71 of 2008 · tax 27%</text></svg>";
